  "scope": "Only55 certificate transitions. Exactly one ORIGINAL equipped Beginner in Primary13 or Secondary14, same evolving identity/family, to certificate target tier2..6. Consume one physical certificate; no new trophy or fresh GUID/CEI identity. All other recipes fall through stock paths.",
  "property": "Deep clone retains owned augments and evolving augment identities, signed native serial, charges, attunement, custom data, timers, task-delivered fields, ornaments, activation/equipped/final evolution identity. Only root template ID and evolution amount/progression change; stored color projection follows native definition rule. Owned new ItemData copy replaces owned old copy. Actual before/after full InventoryProjection and EvolvingItemCustody checked.",
  "atomicity": "Original native session/lease/reservation, exact character/account, exact three recipe roles, actual positive kit or owned open world station, worn full row/GUID/CEI locator and certificate full preimages fenced under strict transaction. Known commit precedes allocation-free map publication; private noncopyable once proof alone permits TradeskillExecute to skip fresh factory output while retaining task count1/normal learning and events. No task/quest history grants.",
  "unknown": "Unknown COMMIT attaches existing shared UnknownInventory admission primitive for this exact original inventory/item tree; no automatic retry/inverse. Exact noninstanced manual world station also quarantined against stale save/delete/reopen until authoritative process reload. No Fungal task/operation whitelist or table reused.",
  "limits": [
    "Requires positive existing native GUID and evolving UID; legacy absent/NULL identity rejects without property mutation.",
    "Unsupported legacy scaling wrapper rejects without dropping scale/custom property.",
    "Manual World certificates require noninstanced object_contents custody because legacy table has no instance dimension. Auto World uses personal certificate and actual owned open station, no object_contents write.",
    "Only certificate transitions implemented. Natural skill-up evolution/type99 thresholds and final level7 are not invented or claimed implemented.",
    "No native gameplay acceptance claimed."
  ],
  "local_policy": "Proposed finite55 literal source NoFail -> native nofail1/trivial0/no-skillups. Omitted skillneeded0/learning0/book0, quest0, enabled1, PoR11 local family floor explicitly labelled; coordinator selection pending.",
