    "behavior": "Before any mutation, actor locks each original captured root/evolving-augment locator and compares existing inventory_guid to original worn-row/native GUID. Any mismatch rejects unchanged. Absent locators retain Capture existing independently checked unique legacy policy. Shared helper unchanged; all other assessed boundaries reused. No new tests/build/SQL/runtime."
